   "id": "pmt/pure-core-1/ch7/q9",
   "question": "<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}p&amp;2\\\\3&amp;p\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\mathbf B=\\begin{pmatrix}-5&amp;4\\\\6&amp;-5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> is a constant.</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li>Find, in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span>, the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf{AB}\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><p>Given that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf{AB}+2\\mathbf A=k\\mathbf I\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a constant and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf I\"></span> is the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\times2\"></span> identity matrix,</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\" start=\"2\"><li>find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span> and the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol></li><li><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M=\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;-9\\\\1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\text{where }a\\text{ is a real constant}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>Triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\"></span> has an area of 15 square units.<br>Triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\"></span> is transformed to the triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T&#x27;\"></span> by the transformation represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M\"></span>.<br>Given that the area of triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T&#x27;\"></span> is 270 square units, find the possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p></li></ol>",
